    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανα-στροφή</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναστροφή</span>
			, <i>return,</i> of the chorus, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				596
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>repetition</i> of the last word or words of a sentence at
			the beginning of the next, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>; of the syllables <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μια</span> in 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαμία μία ναῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1751.40
				</span></i>
			.</div>
